# Follow the master ledger and acceptance criteria

When the user or the task provides any of the following, follow them for that work:

- SpartanLab's master ledger
- Development priorities
- Task acceptance criteria

Do not invent a priority order. Do not mark a ledger item complete. Do not widen the task past the acceptance criteria.

If those sources conflict with the requested code change, stop and ask which source to follow before editing.
